### zh-Hant の訳(common)。英語の locales/en/common.ftl と同じ ID で訳を足す。無い ID は英語で出る。
### Translations for zh-Hant (common). Add entries with the same IDs as locales/en/common.ftl; missing IDs fall back to English.

# common-open-dwg = DWG files cannot be read. Export the file as DXF or STEP in the original application, then open the exported file.
# common-open-dwg-version = Version marker: { $version }
# common-param-batch-enable = Batch edits
# common-param-batch-enable-tip = Keep expression edits pending and apply them together. Turning this off discards pending edits.
# common-param-batch-apply = Apply
# common-param-batch-discard = Discard
# common-param-batch-pending = { $count } pending
# common-param-batch-errors = Fix the expressions before applying

# common-param-expression-label = Expression for { $name }
# common-recovery-discard-all = Discard all
# common-recovery-count = Autosaved copies: { $count }
# common-recovery-confirm = Discard { $count } copies. This cannot be undone
# common-recovery-remains = The copy still exists after deletion. Check applications using it and the folder permissions
# common-recovery-discard-error = Could not discard “{ $name }”: { $reason }
